WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 55 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The man who raised me said I'd never amount to anything as a dragon knight.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.300
But my real father says I'm the dragon god's chosen.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.200
Who am I supposed to believe?

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.200
And what does this mark even mean?

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.000
Am I really resonant with all 12 elements?

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.500
So this is Seraphina's world. It's breathtaking.

7
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.700
And it feels a lifetime away from mine.

8
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.400
My father's life is in danger, yet here I am,

9
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:33.890
living in a palace under Seraphina's protection.

10
00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:36.890
You look troubled. What's eating at you?

11
00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:39.390
My father's still in Mordric's hands. Next move?

12
00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:43.090
Don't worry. They're keeping him breathing as leverage.

13
00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:49.320
But there's something more pressing right now.

14
00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:52.640
Is this what she wants?

15
00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:54.640
What would you prefer? I do it myself.
